derivations.claim:
Applying the connection Leibniz rule to [F2] twice gives $
abla_{\partial_i}
abla_{\partial_j}\partial_k=(\partial_i\Gamma^\ell{}_{jk}+\Gamma^m{}_{jk}\Gamma^\ell{}_{im})\partial_\ell$ and, after interchanging $i,j$, $
abla_{\partial_j}
abla_{\partial_i}\partial_k=(\partial_j\Gamma^\ell{}_{ik}+\Gamma^m{}_{ik}\Gamma^\ell{}_{jm})\partial_\ell$.
